@kpp_contact
title: Open a contact with the KPP
subtitle: Needs relation 10 with the KPP; talks with it become possible from next month.
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !Q.S.actors.kpp_channel.contact_open !}
choose-if: {! return PolishGovernment.kppContactStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_out_kpp_contact_reason +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishGovernment.kppContact(Q);
!}

A first, careful contact with the communists is made. Further cooperation needs separate steps.
